{"title": "Sunlight Hypersensitivity", "pageid": 19269, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sunlight_Hypersensitivity", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp/300px-Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp, /w/images/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp/300px-Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Sunlight Hypersensitivity</b> is a passive feature that causes a creature to take <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage, and have attack roll and ability check disadvantage while in sunlight.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This creature takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">20</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage if it starts its turn in sunlight. While sunlit, it has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Sunlight_Hypersensitivity\"> Condition: Sunlight Hypersensitivity </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sunlight_Hypersensitivity_(Condition)\" title=\"Sunlight Hypersensitivity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sunlight Hypersensitivity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sunlight_Hypersensitivity_(Condition)\" title=\"Sunlight Hypersensitivity (Condition)\">Sunlight Hypersensitivity</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>This creature takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">20 Radiant damage</span> if it starts its turn in sunlight. While sunlit, it has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Andrik\" title=\"Andrik\">Andrik</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Antwun_Dufay\" title=\"Antwun Dufay\">Antwun Dufay</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Aurelia\" title=\"Aurelia\">Aurelia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\">Cazador Szarr</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chessa\" title=\"Chessa\">Chessa</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dalyria\" title=\"Dalyria\">Dalyria</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gondlemead\" title=\"Gondlemead\">Gondlemead</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hapdim\" title=\"Hapdim\">Hapdim</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kass\" title=\"Kass\">Kass</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Leon\" title=\"Leon\">Leon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Misha\" title=\"Misha\">Misha</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Petras\" title=\"Petras\">Petras</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sebastian\" title=\"Sebastian\">Sebastian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vanja\" title=\"Vanja\">Vanja</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Violet\" title=\"Violet\">Violet</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wensleydale\" title=\"Wensleydale\">Wensleydale</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yousen\" title=\"Yousen\">Yousen</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">In sunlight, takes <a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\">radiant</a> damage and has <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">attacks</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">ability checks</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202351\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1776/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16826/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6950/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1000/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 830933/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.438      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   49.438      1 -total\n 34.51%   17.060      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 31.73%   15.685      6 Template:Icon_text\n 29.74%   14.704      1